# mdrender_smoke.numos — shared Markdown render module (src/mdrender) demo host:
# open a note, screenshot page 1, page forward, then a larger font. Ends while
# the reader is active, so the generator's final-frame candidate is meaningful.
#
# The note fixture lives at <fs-root>/notes/demo.md. Point the run at the
# repo's isolated notes root (NOT at tests/emulator/ itself):
#
#   program --headless --deterministic --script tests/emulator/scripts/mdrender_smoke.numos \
#           --fs-root tests/emulator/fs --frames 900 --screenshot out/mdrender_smoke.ppm --quiet
#
# Screenshots written by this script: out/mdrender_page1.ppm, out/mdrender_page2.ppm,
# out/mdrender_large.ppm. Candidate generation (human review gate) is the usual:
#   pio run -e emulator_pc
#   python scripts/generate-emulator-candidates.py         # -> out/emulator-candidates/mdrender_smoke.ppm
#   python scripts/promote-emulator-golden.py mdrender_smoke
#
# Timing (deterministic, step-ms 16):
#   * 200 frames -> splash (~frame 125) done; we are in the launcher.
#   * 60 frames  -> the reader screen loads, parses /notes/demo.md, lays out and
#                   paginates, and draws page 1.
#
# Key map (reader): RIGHT/LEFT change page; F2 = smaller font, F3 = larger font
# (12 / 14 / 20 px); UP/DOWN move the line cursor; AC/MODE leave.
#
# Exit codes: 0 ok · 2 script/parse error · 3 screenshot write error · 4 assertion failure.

log "mdrender_smoke: waiting for launcher"
wait 200

open_app notes
wait 60
assert_app notes
log "mdrender_smoke: reader open (parsed /notes/demo.md)"

# Screenshot BEFORE later keys so the artifact exists even if an assert fails.
screenshot out/mdrender_page1.ppm
log "mdrender_smoke: page 1 captured"

# RIGHT changes page (no intra-page scrolling in the module).
key right
wait 10
screenshot out/mdrender_page2.ppm
assert_app notes
log "mdrender_smoke: page 2 captured"

# F3 = larger font (20 px); repaginates and returns to page 1. The final frame is
# the larger-font page 1, which is what the candidate generator captures.
key f3
wait 10
screenshot out/mdrender_large.ppm
assert_app notes
log "mdrender_smoke: large font captured"
